最後にたどり着く火の池。\nそれが……ゲヘナという処です。","welcome":"我を呼ぶは貴方？　それとも貴方が「悪しき者」？\n……おや。我の主でしたか。\n罪深き悪しき者かと……危うく火の池たるゲヘナに\n投げ込んでしまうところでした。","raw":{"CardID":3151,"ClassID":10800,"DedicatedWeaponID":13034,"Rarity":7,"Tokusei1":20,"VoiceID":1107,"AreaType":13,"FavoriteThings":2,"DotScale":1.0,"HealthCorrection":102,"AttackCorrection":156,"DefenseCorrection":102,"RegenerationCorrection":100,"GrowUpID":8,"GrowUpLimitType":999,"AbilityID":93151,"OrganizedAbilityID":3151,"PossessedAbilityID":3151,"GeneralAbilityID1":100068,"GimmickID":3151,"SpecialAttackID":3151,"OneTimeEffectReactiveType":1,"CutInYCorrection":-200,"MaxRenovationCount":1,"RenovationType":5,"Renovation1AbilityID":94151,"Renovation1GimmickID":4151,"Renovation1SpecialAttackID":4151,"AutoProtect":1}}